# PocketVerse ships as a single-page app (`web.output: "single"` in app.json),
# so there is exactly one HTML document and Expo Router resolves the rest on the
# client. Without this rule a hard refresh or a shared link to a deep route —
# /game/penfight, /modal/settings — would 404 on Cloudflare Pages.
#
# 200 rather than 301: the URL must stay put so the router can read it.
/*    /index.html   200
